{"transcript":"ˌɪnɛfɪˈkeɪʃəs","exists":true,"definitions":["Not producing the desired effect; ineffective.","Lacking the power to produce a desired result."],"examples":["The treatment proved inefficacious.","Their efforts were largely inefficacious.","The inefficacious policy was abandoned."],"lemma":"inefficacious","lemmaPos":"adjective","synonyms":["ineffective","fruitless","useless","futile"],"number":"singular","source":"inefficacious"}